# Values in this file are UNQUOTED. The runtime (lib/env.ts zod transforms)
# automatically strips stray wrapping backticks, double quotes, and single
# quotes on import, so paste-poisoned values still self-heal. But keep this
# template clean to begin with so devs never copy wrapped examples live.

